<metadata><name>Snowlands 1202 Stanislaus Overlook</name><desc>out and back to waypoint 5. 1.8 miles round trip. Line traced from Marcus Libkind's map, tours.snowlands.org/tours/12/1202_tour.htm</desc></metadata>
